# Keep every text file LF in the repository, whatever the working OS does.
#
# Windows KiCad writes CRLF on save, Linux KiCad writes LF (verified 2026-08-08:
# the same board saved on each machine differs only by 149663 CRLF/LF pairs).
# Without normalisation, every save on one machine is a whole-file diff on the
# other. `eol=lf` converts on commit, so the committed bytes are identical no
# matter which machine did the save.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary — never touch these.
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.pdf   binary
*.gz    binary
*.zip   binary
*.otf   binary
*.ttf   binary
*.sldprt binary
*.sldasm binary
*.elibz binary
*.3dshapes binary
